{"id":"memorial_201003","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial201000","label":"OLD TALES · Corruption Report - Unofficial (2/2)"},"label":"Corruption Report VIII - Unofficial","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_201002","next":"memorial_201004","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_201003_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_03_03_description","text":"It has been some time since I left a report."},{"id":"memorial_201003_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_03_03_description","text":"The Corruption has evolved to near-perfection, but there is still one last step remaining."},{"id":"memorial_201003_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_03_03_description","text":"I must confirm what happens when a Grimms Model is infected with Corruption."},{"id":"memorial_201003_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_03_03_description","text":"If my hypothesis is correct, the Rapture will not consume the Grimms Model as a disposable asset. Such a powerful Nikke would be considered valuable even to the Rapture."},{"id":"memorial_201003_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_03_03_description","text":"I'm so excited that I can hardly sleep."},{"id":"memorial_201003_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_03_03_description","text":"What will happen? What will happen?"},{"id":"memorial_201003_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_03_03_description","text":"What will become of Cinderella?"}]}